<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Remarks">Remarks</span></h2>
<p>This function does not appear to work. On entry to a test trigger, the function returns FALSE for both Bioware and custom AddInItem UIDs that are in fact enabled on the in-game DLC screen. Perhaps it is designed to be called from a specific event?
